WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.169
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:06.071
♪♪
Oh! My name is Jimmy Fallon.

00:00:06.071 --> 00:00:08.240
♪♪
Give it up for The Roots!

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:14.279
♪♪
I gotcha!

00:00:14.279 --> 00:00:15.481
Let's get to the news.

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:18.417
[ Cymbal crashes ]

00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:21.587
-Now I'm gonna get it.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:23.422
-Let's get to
the news and jokes.

00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:26.158
Well, guys, the
Democratic convention is over.

00:00:26.158 --> 00:00:29.095
Yep, after four nights,
a message finally popped up

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:32.932
that said, "Your Zoom session
has expired."

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.267
But everyone
is still talking about

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.835
President Obama's big speech.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.970
He did not hold back.
Watch this.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.674 line:0%
-Donald Trump hasn't grown
into the job because he can't.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:44.810 line:0%
I did hope,
for the sake of our country,

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:48.348 line:0%
that Donald Trump
might show some interest

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:50.149 line:0%
in taking the job seriously,

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:53.186 line:0%
that he might come to feel
the weight of the office

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:56.588 line:0%
and discover some reverence
for the democracy

00:00:56.588 --> 00:01:00.460 line:0%
that had been placed in his
care, but he never did.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.596 line:0%
He has shown no interest in
putting in the work,

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:06.532 line:0%
no interest in treating
the presidency as anything

00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:09.602 line:0%
but one more reality show
that he can use

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.838 line:0%
to get the attention he craves.

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:15.541
-Ouch! Obama might have
quit cigarettes,

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:19.478
but he's still smokin'.

00:01:19.478 --> 00:01:21.180
Trump's phone heard that
and was like,

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.514
"Oh, boy, it's going to be
a long night.

00:01:22.514 --> 00:01:26.386
Alright. Can someone throw me in
the toilet, something?"

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:28.287
Man, it's like Michelle
hit Trump with the

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:29.855
"it is what it is" clothesline,

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:34.226
and then Barack finished him off
with an elbow from the top rope.

00:01:34.226 --> 00:01:36.563
That's right -- Obama broke an
unwritten rule about

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:38.230
former U.S. presidents
not attacking

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:39.832
a current U.S. president.

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:40.966
Obama was like, "Oh, come on.

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:46.839
I didn't say anything about
Vladimir Putin."

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:48.674
That's right -- Obama went
all out and said,

00:01:48.674 --> 00:01:51.811
"Trump hasn't grown
because he can't."

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.946
Meanwhile, Trump heard that
and was like, "Wrong.

00:01:53.946 --> 00:02:00.787
I took a pill that makes me
grow just fine."

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:04.324
Obama also accused Trump
of not taking the job seriously.

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:06.759
At that point, Trump was so mad,
he could barely sink his putt

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:11.330
into an empty Pringles can.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.599
Then Obama accused Trump of
turning his presidency

00:02:13.599 --> 00:02:15.234
into a reality show.

00:02:15.234 --> 00:02:16.969
Trump was like, "Wrong again.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:18.404
Now send five people
into my office

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:21.340
so I can decide to who fire."

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:22.808
Meanwhile, during
Obama's speech,

00:02:22.808 --> 00:02:25.978
Trump started live-tweeting
in all-caps.

00:02:25.978 --> 00:02:28.114
By the end of the night,
the imprint of Trump's phone

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:29.682
was burned into his hand
like the bad guy from

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:31.517
"Raiders of the Lost Ark."

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:35.321
It's like...

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:36.889
But, as I said, after four days,

00:02:36.889 --> 00:02:39.125
the Democratic convention
wrapped up tonight.

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.760
They knew it was time to
end the convention

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:45.097
when the calamari
finally went bad.

00:02:45.097 --> 00:02:48.934
The theme of the night was
"America's Promise,"

00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:51.103
which I'm pretty sure was taken
from a supermarket brand

00:02:51.103 --> 00:02:52.839
of butter and cheese.

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:56.943
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:59.112
"Do you want to get the --
Should we get the Kraft Singles

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:03.916
or do you want to get
America's Promise?"

00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:06.352
Also, somehow, America's Promise
sounds like

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:11.090
an adult-diaper
brand started by Mike Pence.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.926
"That's why I
use America's Promise.

00:03:13.926 --> 00:03:15.728
Make the promise to --"

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:18.097
Here's the big story today.

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:21.433
Another one of President Trump's
close associates got indicted.

00:03:21.433 --> 00:03:24.570
Let's see who it is!

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:27.173 line:0%
-Former Trump campaign
senior adviser Steve Bannon

00:03:27.173 --> 00:03:29.842 line:0%
has been arrested
and charged with fraud

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:31.511 line:0%
by federal prosecutors
in New York.

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:34.814 line:0%
He and three others are accused
of orchestrating a scheme

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:38.717 line:0%
to defraud donors out of
hundreds of thousands of dollars

00:03:38.717 --> 00:03:42.155 line:0%
that the donors thought were
all going to help fund

00:03:42.155 --> 00:03:43.922 line:0%
the president's border wall.

00:03:43.922 --> 00:03:47.193
-Yep, Steve Bannon was arrested
and placed in the

00:03:47.193 --> 00:03:51.130
Trump's "well-wishes" section
of the prison.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:53.866
That's right -- another Trump
associate is going to prison.

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:55.901
At this point,
The White House softball team

00:03:55.901 --> 00:04:01.274
and the prison softball
team have the exact same lineup.

00:04:01.274 --> 00:04:02.842
I don't know.
Maybe these charges are nothing.

00:04:02.842 --> 00:04:07.246
I mean, does Steve Bannon
look guilty to you?

00:04:07.246 --> 00:04:08.981
Oh, yeah. Oh, yeah.
He definitely does.

00:04:08.981 --> 00:04:10.182
Oh, just so you know,
by the way,

00:04:10.182 --> 00:04:12.251
that's how he looked
before he got arrested.

00:04:12.251 --> 00:04:14.720
He looks like someone
you'd find sleeping

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.457
in the bathroom stall
at Margaritaville.

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:22.629
He looks likes an unemployed
Martha Washington impersonator.

00:04:25.498 --> 00:04:28.534
He looks like a guy who yells
at Little Leaguers

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:31.604
when he doesn't have
a kid on the team.

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:33.839
He looks like every composite
photo of what Elvis

00:04:33.839 --> 00:04:36.709
would look like
if he were alive today.

00:04:36.709 --> 00:04:39.912
Can we see the picture again?

00:04:39.912 --> 00:04:41.246
He looks like every guy
who has ever tried

00:04:41.246 --> 00:04:44.116
to sell me a Jacuzzi.

00:04:44.116 --> 00:04:45.852
He looks like every guy at
the hotel hot tub

00:04:45.852 --> 00:04:49.122
who sits way too close
to your wife.

00:04:49.122 --> 00:04:50.389
He looks like every man
who has ever

00:04:50.389 --> 00:04:53.926
walked into
a Ferrari dealership.

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:55.161
He looks like his home address

00:04:55.161 --> 00:04:57.296
is the swim-up bar
at the mirage.

00:04:57.296 --> 00:05:00.566
[ Laughter ]

00:05:00.566 --> 00:05:02.201
That's the one. Come on.
-No.

00:05:02.201 --> 00:05:04.270
-That's the one.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.705
Well, guys,
here's some good news.

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:08.607
Out in Colorado, you can now buy
weed out of a vending machine.

00:05:08.607 --> 00:05:09.776
Take a look at this.

00:05:09.776 --> 00:05:11.877
And you think you freak out
when your Kit Kat

00:05:11.877 --> 00:05:13.078
gets stuck in the machine.

00:05:13.078 --> 00:05:17.450
"Oh, come on man!
I need that Purple Twilight!"

00:05:20.119 --> 00:05:23.455
And, finally, a group of...

00:05:23.455 --> 00:05:25.291
I don't know my
weed names at all.

00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:28.995
-Eh, you're good.
-That sounds like one.

00:05:28.995 --> 00:05:30.663
-I've never heard of
Purple Twilight.

00:05:30.663 --> 00:05:33.699
-Oh, then you never heard of
anything, man!

00:05:33.699 --> 00:05:37.036
[ Laughter ]

00:05:40.406 --> 00:05:43.442
You got your Purple Twilight.

00:05:43.442 --> 00:05:47.680
You got your O.G. Kush,
you know?

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:52.452
You got your, you know,
Spanxgiving."

00:05:56.289 --> 00:05:58.557
Finally, a group of researchers
in Finland

00:05:58.557 --> 00:06:01.660
said that they've discovered
a cure for hangovers.

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:02.762
Everyone was like, "Yeah,

00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:04.129
there's already been
a hangover cure.

00:06:04.129 --> 00:06:06.432
It's called more booze."

00:06:06.432 --> 00:06:08.400
Actually, good news -- they just
tested it out on Steve Bannon,

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:09.501
and look at him now.

00:06:09.501 --> 00:06:12.705
We have great show
for you tonight.

